    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Keane Thompson are proud to present 3 Roseville Court, a beautifully positioned two-bedroom ground floor apartment situated within this popular gated development on the Dublin Road, Bray. Extending to approximately 60 sq. m. (646 sq. ft.), this well-proportioned property offers bright and comfortable accommodation throughout and will appeal to a wide range of purchasers, including first-time buyers, downsizers and investors.\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises an entrance hallway opening into a generous living room, which features a charming open fireplace and provides a warm and welcoming space for everyday living. Located off the living room, the kitchen is fitted with a selection of floor and wall-mounted units and provides ample storage and workspace."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "There are two spacious double bedrooms, both benefiting from built-in wardrobes and glazed doors providing direct access to the private rear garden. A fully tiled family bathroom completes the accommodation and is fitted with a bath, electric shower, wash hand basin and WC.\r\nThe apartment is presented in very good condition throughout and benefits from new laminate flooring, double glazed windows and electric storage heating. To the rear, the private south-facing patio and garden offer an excellent outdoor area and enjoy plenty of sunshine. The development is further enhanced by the grasses communal children's play area. \r\n\r\nEntrance Hall\r\nLaminate flooring \r\n\r\nLiving room\r\nLaminate flooring, storage room, fireplace\r\n\r\nKitchen\r\nTiled floor and splashback, electric hob.\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\nWHB, WC, Bath with electric shower, partly tiled \r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\nFitted wardrobe, door to patio \r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\nFitted wardrobe, door to patio"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "1.Spacious 60 sq. m. apartment in a sought-after development.\r\n2.Two double bedrooms: both feature built-in wardrobes and an external door onto the patio area.\r\n3.Private rear garden direct access to a private, south-facing patio\r\n4.Prime location, walking distance to Bray DART Station and town centre\r\n5.Easy access to the N11/M50 road network. \r\n6.Bright living room with an inviting open fireplace\r\n7.Mature development with an established, private gated community\r\n8.Annual management fee: €1,530\r\n9.Parking and amenities includes ample communal parking and proximity to all local amenities\r\n10.New laminate flooring throughout and recently redecorated"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: C"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "Roseville Court is a mature and well-established private gated development, comprising a selection of apartments, duplexes and townhouses. The location is particularly convenient, with Bray DART Station within walking distance and regular bus services close by. The N11 and M50 are also easily accessible, providing excellent connectivity to Dublin and surrounding areas.\r\n\r\nBray itself offers an excellent choice of amenities, including a variety of shops, cafés, restaurants, schools and leisure facilities. The popular Bray Promenade and the spectacular Bray to Greystones Cliff Walk are also close by, providing wonderful opportunities for coastal walks and recreation.\r\nWith generous accommodation, a private south-facing outdoor space, ample communal parking and an enviable location close to a host of amenities and transport links, No. 3 Roseville Court presents an excellent opportunity to acquire a well-positioned two-bedroom apartment in a highly regarded Bray development."
      }
    ],
